<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CompuServe cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CompuServe cut to neutral.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it downgraded CompuServe Corp to long-term neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- Kept CompuServe as near-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
</text>
